	(text "Channel 1 (T1/R1): Pi UART0, GPIO 14/15.\nChannel 2 (T2/R2): Pi UART2, GPIO 4/5\n(dtoverlay=uart2-pi5, /dev/ttyAMA2).\nJ301 pinout as on the 2026 board (J8):\npin 2 = TX to POPS, pin 3 = RX from POPS,\npin 5 = GND. Check it against POPS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
